ommunicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "present", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a thing you give to a person on a special day", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He gets a lot of presents on his birthday.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you shop.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "gift", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a present", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She sometimes gives him gifts.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "thriller", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a scary book or film", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't read thrillers at night!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sci-fi", "type": "name"}, {"content": "short for science fiction; a book or film about life and science in the future.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We love sci-fi films with aliens and life on other planets.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mystery", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a book or film about a crime", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He loves to read mysteries by Agatha Christie.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "opera", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a play where words are sung", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't like opera. I hate all the singing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "classical music", "type": "name"}, {"content": "European music from the 18th and 19th centuries", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He likes classical music. I prefer pop.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "birthday", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the date of your birth", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She has a birthday party every year.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to remember", "type": "name"}, {"content": "think about a past event", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Remember our last holiday.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob03aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Using the Modal Can for Ability", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modal <span class=\"italic\">can</span> to say you have an ability or know how to  do something. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Can is followed by a second verb. <span class=\"italic\">i.e. <span class=\"italic\">can</span> + verb</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For the negative you use <span class=\"italic\">can't or cannot</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I can cook. <br>He can run very fast.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I know how to cook.<br /> He is able to run fast.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She can't sing at all.<br /> I cannot speak Italian.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She is not able to sing.<br /> I do not know how to speak Italian.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Using the Modal Can for Permission", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use the modal <span class=\"italic\">can</span> to ask for permission or give someone permission.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Alice</span>: Can I smoke here?<br />  <span class=\"strong\">Mark</span>: No, you can't smoke here.<br />           You can smoke in the garden.<br /> <br />  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ellen</span>: Can we stop at this store? <br /> <span class=\"strong\">Susan</span>: Sure.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go to a bookstore and music store - online or in person.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the types of books and movies.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of books and movies that you like.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look up new words in English. Say the types of books and movies out loud.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Tell someone what type of books and movies you like.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I make a list of books and movies that I like.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I look up words I don't know in a dictionary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice saying types of books and movies.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say what kind of books and movies I like.", "type": "text"}]}]}